<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/inventions?focus=caravel">Inventions &amp; Discoveries</a> · Transport and navigation</p><h1 class="enc-title">Caravel</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">A caravel was a small, highly manoeuvrable sailing ship, often with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lateen-sail">lateen</a> sails that allowed it to sail close to the wind. It developed from the fishing boats of Portugal and the Atlantic coast of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/spain">Spain</a>; the word is first recorded in Portuguese in 1255, and in the fifteenth century the Portuguese made it the ship of their voyages of exploration along the African coast. The caravel was a key tool of the early maritime expansion of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/portuguese-empire">Portuguese Empire</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/caravel.jpg" alt="Caravel" width="320" height="464" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Lopo Pizarro · CC BY 2.5 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Caravela_Vera_Cruz_no_rio_Tejo.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="inv-entry"><h2 class="enc-section-title">On the inventions tree</h2><dl class="inv-entry-facts"><div><dt>First known</dt><dd>c. 1255</dd></div><div><dt>Where</dt><dd>Galicia, Portugal and Andalusia</dd></div><div><dt>Credited to</dt><dd><a href="/empire/kingdom-of-portugal">Kingdom of Portugal</a> · <a href="/empire/crown-of-castile">Crown of Castile</a></dd></div></dl><p class="inv-entry-note"><span class="inv-k">Note</span>The name covered different hulls over the centuries; the ocean-going caravel of the voyages of exploration was developed in 15th-century Portugal.</p><div class="inv-entry-rel"><span class="inv-k">Built on</span><a class="inv-chip" href="/encyclopedia/sternpost-rudder">Sternpost rudder<span>1st century CE</span></a><a class="inv-chip" href="/encyclopedia/lateen-sail">Lateen sail<span>2nd century CE</span></a></div><p class="enc-article-foot"><a class="enc-random-link" href="/inventions?focus=caravel">See it on the inventions tree &rarr;</a></p></section>
